  "details": "I'm not quite sure what causes the crash but it has happened to me on various worlds from Murder 2 to Never Have I Ever to Mr Dummy's sign and fun. It seems to trigger after an fps drop or lag spike and after having played in a world for long enough, and what will happen is your screen will freeze entirely but ingame you will still be able to move, talk, and hear others like normal. Activating the panic button to enable safe mode will crash the game in this state.",
